# Cursor / AI coding rules for SkillMap

You are working on the SkillMap project (interactive skill map for students).

ALWAYS read and follow:
1. AGENTS.md (root) — primary source of truth
2. docs/ folder for domain, architecture, API, UI-kit, MVP scope

Key constraints:
- Stack: Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind + FSD | FastAPI + PostgreSQL
- Structure: apps/frontend + apps/backend
- Only implement MVP Must features (see docs/06-mvp-scope.md)
- Use existing UI-kit tokens and components (docs/04-ui-kit.md)
- Russian UI texts
- Do not invent features outside scope
- Follow FSD import rules strictly

When in doubt — check AGENTS.md and the relevant docs file before writing code.
